@page "/account/sign-out-failed"
@attribute [ExcludeFromInteractiveRouting]

@* Sign-out keeps the session when Supabase can't revoke it, so a copied cookie can't outlive the member's sign-out (NFR-SEC-4). *@

<PageTitle>Couldn't sign out · FitCore</PageTitle>

<h1>You're still signed in</h1>
<p>FitCore couldn't reach its sign-in service to end your session. Try again in a moment.</p>

<form method="post" action="account/sign-out" data-enhance="false">
    <AntiforgeryToken />
    <button type="submit">Sign out</button>
</form>
